  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Talabat/workbooks/NewHealthTab-WIP/Definitions?rev=' id='Definitions' path='/t/Talabat/workbooks/NewHealthTab' revision='' site='Talabat' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1500' maxwidth='1700' minheight='1500' minwidth='1700' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98934' id='3' type-v2='text' w='99058' x='471' y='533'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='10'>Monthly KPIs:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Overall Performance</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption%</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of Talabat Pro (tpro) subscribers active at the end of the month (for completed months) or the latest date (for the current month) divided by total number of Talabat active users during the same period (for completed months) or over the rolling 30 days (for the current month).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption% from Addressable Base</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro subscribers active at the end of the month from the Addressable Base dividd by the total Talabat Addressable Base.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='8' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>      Addressable Base: Talabat users who have saved in delivery fees an amount equal to or greater than the monthly plan price (based on LTP) at least once in the last  6 months and made and online payment   transaction at least once in the last 6 months.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>       The current Addressable logic accounts for historical MOV changes, but the plan price is based on current commercials.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer GMV Coverage%: </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>The GMV of tpro subscribers in the month divided by the total Talabat GMV in the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer GMV MTD%</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The GMV of tpro subscribers month-to-date divided by the total Talabat GMV month-to-date.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer Savings Multiple:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The ratio of tpro savings to membership cost.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>       tpro savings: Delivery fee savings and rewards savings (for UAE, based on 2X points benefit for tpro customers—all rewards discount savings attributed to tpro. For other countries, savings on tpro exclusive rewards vouchers only are considered).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>        Customer Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Active tpro subscribers</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The number of tpro users active on the pro plan at the end of the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>LTP Adoption%:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of tpro users active on a long-term plan at the end of the month compared to the total tpro active subscribers at the end of the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Acquisitions &amp; Winbacks</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: Includes all acquisitions and winbacks (organic + billing retry winbacks). Winbacks follow the logic in the Net User Movement dashboard, where winbacks in the month are users who were inactive on pro last month and are active on tpro at the end of this month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Churned %</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of total churned users (voluntary + involuntary in the month) compared to the total users up for renewal in the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Voluntary Churn %</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro subscribers who churned without entering the Grace Period or Billing Retry compared to the total users up for renewal.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Involuntary Churn %</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro subscribers who churned after entering the Grace Period or Billing Retry compared to the total users up for renewal.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Utilization %</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro orders by tpro subscribers divided by the total orders by tpro subscribers.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders below MOV (Food):</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of food orders by tpro subscribers below the Minimum Order Value (MOV) in the month divided by the total orders by tpro subscribers in the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders below MOV (NFV)</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of NFV orders by tpro subscribers below the MOV in the month divided by the  total orders by tpro subscribers in the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders below MOV (tmart)</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tmart orders by tpro subscribers below the MOV in the month divided by the  total orders by tpro subscribers in the month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders on non-pro vendors</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of non-pro orders on non-pro vendors by tpro subscribers in the month divided by the  total orders by tpro subscribers in the mo</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Vendor Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor Count Coverage% (Overall):</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The number of tpro vendors at the end of the month with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; divided by the total number of Talabat vendors with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; in the same month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor Count Coverage% (Food</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>): The number of tpro Food vendors at the end of the month with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; divided by the total number of Talabat Food vendors with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; in the same month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor Count Coverage% (NFV)</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The number of tpro NFV (excluding tmart) vendors at the end of the month with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; divided by the total number of Talabat NFV (excluding tmart) vendors with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; in the same month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor GMV Coverage% (Overall):</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The GMV of tpro vendors at the end of the month divided by the total Talabat GMV in the same month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor GMV Coverage% (Food):</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The GMV of tpro Food vendors at the end of the month divided by the total Talabat Food GMV in the same month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor GMV Coverage% (NFV):</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The GMV of tpro NFV (excluding tmart) vendors at the end of the month divided by the total Talabat NFV (excluding tmart) GMV in the same month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Weekly KPIs:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>tpro Subscribers:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>The number of tpro users active on the pro plan at the end of the week.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Acquisitions &amp; Winbacks:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>The number of acquisitions and winbacks in the week. Winbacks are determined using the Net User Movement Dashboard logic, where winbacks are users who were inactive on the program at the end of the last week but active at the end of the current week.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption%:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The ratio of tpro subscribers at the end of the week to the total number of Talabat users over the last 30 rolling days from the week’s end.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption% from Addressable Bas</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>e: tpro subscribers end of the week from Addressable Base/ Talabat Users in the rolling 30 days from week start date in the Addressable Base</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer GMV Coverage</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of tpro subscribers&apos; GMV in the week to the total Talabat GMV in the week.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer Order Share%</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of orders by tpro subscribers in the week to the total Talabat orders in the week</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>LTP Adoption%:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of tpro subscribers active on a long-term plan (LTP) at the end of the week compared to the total tpro subscribers active at the end of the week</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Utilization%</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of pro orders by tpro subscribers in the week to the total orders by subscribers in the week.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of Orders from Non-Pro Vendors:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The ratio of non-pro orders by tpro subscribers on non-pro vendors in the week to the total orders by subscribers in the week.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Churned%:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of total churned users in the week compared to the total users up for renewal in the week.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>GMV Vendor Coverage%</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of tpro vendor GMV in the week divided  the total Talabat GMV in the week. (tpro vendor status established at the end of the week, zombie and active status established during the week)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='228' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='227' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98934' id='3' type-v2='text' w='99058' x='471' y='533'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='10'>Monthly KPIs:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Overall Performance</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption%</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of Talabat Pro (tpro) subscribers active at the end of the month (for completed months) or the latest date (for the current month) divided by total number of Talabat active users during the same period (for completed months) or over the rolling 30 days (for the current month).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption% from Addressable Base</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro subscribers active at the end of the month from the Addressable Base dividd by the total Talabat Addressable Base.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='8' italic='true'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>      Addressable Base: Talabat users who have saved in delivery fees an amount equal to or greater than the monthly plan price (based on LTP) at least once in the last  6 months and made and online payment   transaction at least once in the last 6 months.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>       The current Addressable logic accounts for historical MOV changes, but the plan price is based on current commercials.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer GMV Coverage%: </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>The GMV of tpro subscribers in the month divided by the total Talabat GMV in the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer GMV MTD%</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The GMV of tpro subscribers month-to-date divided by the total Talabat GMV month-to-date.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer Savings Multiple:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The ratio of tpro savings to membership cost.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>       tpro savings: Delivery fee savings and rewards savings (for UAE, based on 2X points benefit for tpro customers—all rewards discount savings attributed to tpro. For other countries, savings on tpro exclusive rewards vouchers only are considered).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>        Customer Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Active tpro subscribers</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The number of tpro users active on the pro plan at the end of the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>LTP Adoption%:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of tpro users active on a long-term plan at the end of the month compared to the total tpro active subscribers at the end of the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Acquisitions &amp; Winbacks</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: Includes all acquisitions and winbacks (organic + billing retry winbacks). Winbacks follow the logic in the Net User Movement dashboard, where winbacks in the month are users who were inactive on pro last month and are active on tpro at the end of this month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Churned %</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of total churned users (voluntary + involuntary in the month) compared to the total users up for renewal in the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Voluntary Churn %</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro subscribers who churned without entering the Grace Period or Billing Retry compared to the total users up for renewal.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Involuntary Churn %</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro subscribers who churned after entering the Grace Period or Billing Retry compared to the total users up for renewal.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Utilization %</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tpro orders by tpro subscribers divided by the total orders by tpro subscribers.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders below MOV (Food):</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of food orders by tpro subscribers below the Minimum Order Value (MOV) in the month divided by the total orders by tpro subscribers in the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders below MOV (NFV)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of NFV orders by tpro subscribers below the MOV in the month divided by the  total orders by tpro subscribers in the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders below MOV (tmart)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of tmart orders by tpro subscribers below the MOV in the month divided by the  total orders by tpro subscribers in the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of orders on non-pro vendors</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The percentage of non-pro orders on non-pro vendors by tpro subscribers in the month divided by the  total orders by tpro subscribers in the mo</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Vendor Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor Count Coverage% (Overall):</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The number of tpro vendors at the end of the month with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; divided by the total number of Talabat vendors with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; in the same month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor Count Coverage% (Food</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>): The number of tpro Food vendors at the end of the month with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; divided by the total number of Talabat Food vendors with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; in the same month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor Count Coverage% (NFV)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The number of tpro NFV (excluding tmart) vendors at the end of the month with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; divided by the total number of Talabat NFV (excluding tmart) vendors with the status &quot;is_zombie&quot; or &quot;is_active&quot; in the same month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor GMV Coverage% (Overall):</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The GMV of tpro vendors at the end of the month divided by the total Talabat GMV in the same month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor GMV Coverage% (Food):</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The GMV of tpro Food vendors at the end of the month divided by the total Talabat Food GMV in the same month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Vendor GMV Coverage% (NFV):</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The GMV of tpro NFV (excluding tmart) vendors at the end of the month divided by the total Talabat NFV (excluding tmart) GMV in the same month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Weekly KPIs:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>tpro Subscribers:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>The number of tpro users active on the pro plan at the end of the week.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Acquisitions &amp; Winbacks:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>The number of acquisitions and winbacks in the week. Winbacks are determined using the Net User Movement Dashboard logic, where winbacks are users who were inactive on the program at the end of the last week but active at the end of the current week.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption%:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The ratio of tpro subscribers at the end of the week to the total number of Talabat users over the last 30 rolling days from the week’s end.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Adoption% from Addressable Bas</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>e: tpro subscribers end of the week from Addressable Base/ Talabat Users in the rolling 30 days from week start date in the Addressable Base</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer GMV Coverage</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of tpro subscribers&apos; GMV in the week to the total Talabat GMV in the week.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Customer Order Share%</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of orders by tpro subscribers in the week to the total Talabat orders in the week</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>LTP Adoption%:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of tpro subscribers active on a long-term plan (LTP) at the end of the week compared to the total tpro subscribers active at the end of the week</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Utilization%</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of pro orders by tpro subscribers in the week to the total orders by subscribers in the week.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>% of Orders from Non-Pro Vendors:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The ratio of non-pro orders by tpro subscribers on non-pro vendors in the week to the total orders by subscribers in the week.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>Churned%:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'> The percentage of total churned users in the week compared to the total users up for renewal in the week.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff' fontsize='8'>GMV Vendor Coverage%</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='8'>: The ratio of tpro vendor GMV in the week divided  the total Talabat GMV in the week. (tpro vendor status established at the end of the week, zombie and active status established during the week)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{242FBDAD-C561-457C-A453-3BC25D8C1707}' />
    </dashboard>
